OL,3,GNEWSA'My daughter's death wasn't enough
OL,4,Ato stop sewage spills'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Bromsgrove mother whose daughter died
OL,7,Fafter contracting E. coli on a beach
OL,8,Fhas joined campaigners at Downing
OL,9,FStreet to hand in a petition calling
OL,10,Ffor reform of the water industry.
OL,12,FJulie Maughan's eight-year-old
OL,13,Fdaughter, Heather Preen, died in 1999
OL,14,Fwhile on holiday in Devon. Her story
OL,15,Fwas dramatised in Channel 4's
OL,16,Fprogramme, Dirty Business, earlier this
OL,17,Fyear. South West Water said an
OL,18,Finvestigation found no source of her
OL,19,Finfection.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,356,350,200,160,0,100
