OL,3,GNEWSA'My daughter's death wasn't enough
OL,4,Ato stop sewage spills'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Department for Environment, Food &
OL,7,FRural Affairs (Defra) said it was
OL,8,Fworking on the "biggest overhaul of the
OL,9,Fwater sector in a generation".
OL,11,FBut the petition, by the campaign group
OL,12,FSurfers Against Sewage, says the Clean
OL,13,FWater Bill must end the privatised
OL,14,Fwater industry altogether.
